## 8. Limitations

- An internet connection is required for map tiles and online search.
- Users must grant location permission to find their current position.
- Public services may have usage limits or temporary availability issues.
- Walking directions open on the OpenStreetMap website rather than being drawn directly on the MapEase map.
- The application does not store location history or provide live traffic information.

